@startuml

|User|
start
:Login;
:Open workout dashboard;
:Click "Create Workout" button;

|System|
:Load exercise list;

|User|
:Browse exercises;
:Click "View Video" on exercise;

|System|
:Retrieve exercise tutorial video;
if (Video available?) then (Yes)
  :Open exercise video viewer;
  :Play tutorial video;
else (No)
  :Display video unavailable error;
endif

|User|
:View exercise tutorial;
:Return to exercise list;
stop

@enduml
